# Markdown Documentation

- Use UK English spelling.
- For general documentation, use the `project-documentation` skill in `.agents/skills/`.
- Ground content in `GOALS.md` and `CONVENTIONS.md`.
- For ADRs under `adr/` (if present), use `create-architectural-decision-record` instead of general documentation skills.
